   22581/   1B62C :                     ; ZONE ANIMATION PROCEDURES AND SCRIPTS
   22582/   1B62C :                     ;
   22583/   1B62C :                     ; Each zone gets two entries in this jump table. The first entry points to the
   22584/   1B62C :                     ; zone's animation procedure (usually Dynamic_Null, AKA none). The second points
   22585/   1B62C :                     ; to the zone's animation script.
   22586/   1B62C :                     ;
   22587/   1B62C :                     ; Seems like stage IDs were already being shifted, since listings for $07-$0F
   22588/   1B62C :                     ; can be found, alongside HPZ's art listed from $08 (its ID in the final).
